  "classIri": "urn:ngm:class:self-presence",
  "domain": "distributed-collaboration",
  "definition": "The subjective sense that one's virtual or avatar representation in a mediated environment is a genuine extension of the physical self \u2014 encompassing body ownership, proprioceptive coherence, and self-location within virtual space. Self presence is a component of overall presence and a prerequisite for authentic immersive collaboration, as it governs how naturally users interact with and move through shared virtual environments.",
